---
description: React UI conventions
globs: src/app/**,src/state/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- Function components and hooks only. App state lives in Zustand stores under `src/state/`, one store per concern (paints, cup, tools, sim).
- The UI controls the simulation only through `SimController` (from `src/sim`). Never touch GPU objects from components.
- Don't re-render React every sim frame. The canvas is driven by a requestAnimationFrame loop owned by the sim, and React reads stats at a low rate.
- Pointer tools (pour, torch, air, swipe, string) send input events to the SimController in canvas coordinates (0..1).
- Plain CSS modules. No UI kit for now.
